      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty poetic way to look at it, but it doesn't change the reality. it feels more like a void than a silence. like the well is just dry. i don't think there's anything left to pull up. what's the point of just existing if there's nothing left to create? it just feels like waiting for something that's never coming back.",
